  engimonoDescriptions:
  - 'A very fun game! It''s like a boss rush with music and combat mechanics! I should
    try it later today, but first I gotta fix the train! '
  - It's a game about egyptian folklore. There are monsters and spirits! Maybe someday
    I can invite them to the Yurei Ressha if they want...
  - Seems like a narrative game about walking... and walking... Why don't that guy
    just hop on the train already?!
